  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung demands his sons tell him what they have been doing.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now, tell your old father what you have been about!\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and my second son is setting up a grain market for himself and he is getting ready with his own hands and he has got a good price for his grain and there are many men who come to him.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung's sons help him to prepare for a banquet.",
  "[action] Wang Lung and his sons prepare for a banquet.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung asks his sons where they got the money for the feast.",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son bring money to Wang Lung.",
  "the eldest son: \"Now we have made a great feast and it is all ready for your father.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung stops his sons from entering.",
  "[action] Wang Lung stands before his sons, holding a basket of money.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"No---no---we will not eat it in this old room. We will eat it in the great hall!\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung gives money to second son",
  "[action] (to the second son) Wang Lung asks his son to buy pork.",
  "[action] (to the second son) The second son buys pork.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Now you will buy the beans and the onions and the sugar and I will buy the rice.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung tells his sons to prepare the feast.",
  "[action] Wang Lung gives money to eldest son",
